OL,3,GNEWSAWhere to see seventh annual
OL,4,AChristmas Tractor Run
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of people across Warwickshire
OL,7,Fare expected to line the streets when
OL,8,Fan annual Christmas Tractor Run returns
OL,9,Fthis winter.
OL,11,FMore than 50 illuminated tractors will
OL,12,Ftake part in the festive event, which
OL,13,Faims to raise money for local charities
OL,14,Fwhile bringing Christmas cheer to
OL,15,Fcommunities.
OL,17,FThe parade will take place on 11-12
OL,18,FDecember, with tractors gathering from
OL,19,F15.30 GMT before setting off at 17:00
OL,20,Fon both days.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
