OL,3,GNEWSAWhere to see seventh annual
OL,4,AChristmas Tractor Run
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe brightly decorated convoy will
OL,7,Ftravel through Atherstone, Nuneaton,
OL,8,FBedworth and Coventry. Organisers said
OL,9,Fthe routes would be similar to previous
OL,10,Fyears, with maps and timing information
OL,11,Fpublished online.
